# Normalise line endings in the repository so a Windows checkout and a Linux one
# produce the same bytes. Text files are checked out with LF; the Windows tooling
# (PowerShell scripts) is exempted so it stays readable in an editor.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.dmg binary
*.msi binary
*.AppImage binary
